Note on generated models

This license covers the toolkit itself (skills, agents, tools and docs). It
does not cover the p3d files the Model Forge pipeline generates from Bohemia
Interactive's vanilla DayZ bodies (DayZ-Misc): those are derivative material
under the Arma and DayZ Public License Share Alike (ADPL-SA) and follow its
terms, not this license. This repository does not ship the vanilla bodies or
any p3d made from them.
